Features:
- subtrees
- search for node name
- show node id
- control-child edge should display an index to indicate the ticking order of child nodes
- node position in the editor should correspond to child index of control node (children sorted from left to right)
- long term there should be button to align the nodes in the tree
- resize nodes
- show selected params
- allow to change params


Improvements:
- split domain and ui related data and implement coordination layer. This will decouple ui element props and make rendering more efficient 
- Once 0.7 becomes stable use Store instead of Signal<HashMap<T, V>> (https://github.com/DioxusLabs/docsite/pull/538)
- error context + error types
- harmonize {Channel, Edge, Node}Id types. They should be distinct types, at least wrap in a newtype

UX:
- tailwindcss
- focus mouse when rendering temp edge and in proximity of a port